'''Charcadet''' (Japanese: '''カルボウ''' ''Carbou'') is a {{ct|Fire}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Paldean Wonders}} expansion.

