==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Scarlet & Violet|Charcadet|39}} from the {{TCG|Scarlet & Violet}} expansion.
*'''Punch''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Machop|59}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

